(40, 5, 5, 'Unit 5 – K4, K5', 12.0, '[\"K4, K5\",\"Example Question Bank Questions\",\"K2 \\u2013 Understand\",\"Explain the importance of defining a clear problem statement before starting a software project\",\"K3 \\u2013 Apply\",\"A college wants to develop an online student attendance system. Identify the major functional requirements that should be included in the proposed system\",\"K4 \\u2013 Analyze\",\"Analyze an existing student management system and identify three limitations that could be addressed by a proposed improved system\",\"Analyze the requirements of a college management application and determine suitable modules for students\",\"professors\",\"HODs\",\"and administrators\",\"K5 \\u2013 Evaluate\",\"Evaluate two possible technology stacks for a web-based college management system and justify the technology stack that would be more appropriate\",\"A project team has limited time and resources. Evaluate the major risks associated with the proposed project and recommend suitable mitigation strategies\"]', '[\"Explain key concepts of K4, K5\",\"Apply techniques related to K4, K5\"]', 'K5', NULL, '[\"Lecture\",\"Discussion\",\"Demo\"]', '[\"Quiz\",\"Assignment\"]', NULL, 9, NULL);

